Name Rio Note - Misc #7 Black Market

Interactability_Text_Line_0 Today we are are expecting at least 2 anonymous purchases; particular note to one "Red Parrot", who asked for military-grade supplies for an operation out beyond the Coalition's containment belt.
Interactability_Text_Line_1 If officers, military or otherwise, show up, try to turn them away. In case of questions being asked, try to persuade them with a 'small exchange of favours'.
Interactability_Text_Line_2 Avoid antagonizing the Military, as we barely escaped the last visit by the Authority's officers.